  "section_encoding": {
    "cases": "drillFiltersForGroupKey(field, key, now) / drill_filters_for_group_key (WP13 §3.2), with now = now_local read as local wall-clock time. field: {id, type (FieldType), date_condition (a DateConditionPB name: Relative, Day, Week, Month, Year; Month when absent), number_bucket_size (the resolved range size of a Number axis; absent means unknown)}. A null field (the Number chart, or an X field that no longer exists) or the key \"\" gives {kind: none}. expect.kind is filters (the category nodes, AND-ed, in this order), rows (the row-set fallback: the clicked cell's row ids become an allow-list) or none. A filter is {field_id, ty, condition, content}; a date filter has `date` instead of `content`: a local calendar date whose content is {\"timestamp\": <that date's local midnight in seconds>}, so the fixture is time-zone independent. Node ids (drill:x:<n> and drill:sub:<n>) and filter_type (2) are not compared.",
