    "open_pages_in": "resolveOpenPagesIn(raw, source) / resolve_open_pages_in (WP13 §3.8): a known raw value (side_peek, center_peek, full_page) wins; anything else (null, \"\", an unknown string) reads as absent: source dashboard_widget or drilldown gives side_peek, view gives center_peek. A mobile context opens records full screen before this resolver runs."
